NoNDesign offline A2UI web preview page

The generated page (app/assets/a2ui_web/) bundles the official A2UI web
renderer and its runtime dependencies, all built from the pinned npm packages
in this directory. The generated page contains no third-party network
references: it is loaded from an inline HTML string and its Content-Security-
Policy allows no connections (`default-src 'none'; connect-src 'none'`).

